{"unit_id":"c5d2db30d9200adbf4b8","title":"提案：有關西醫基層醫療費用內科審查注意事項-降血脂藥物審查原則增訂","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b10","raw_text":"提案：有關西醫基層醫療費用內科審查注意事項-降血脂藥物審查原則增訂\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[36.0,327.22601318359375,555.8400268554688,343.1860046386719]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b11","raw_text":"原因乙節。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":7,"bbox":[64.34400177001953,357.22601318359375,152.36000061035156,373.1860046386719]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b12","raw_text":"說明：關於藥品給付規定降血脂類藥品之相關規定，於102 年已有異動，並\n","start_char":0,"end_char":36,"bbox":[36.119998931884766,387.22601318359375,559.1676635742188,403.1860046386719]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b13","raw_text":"且刪除「如已達治療目的得考慮減量至最低有效劑量」等內容。重申應\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[64.2239990234375,417.22601318359375,559.2000122070312,433.1860046386719]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b14","raw_text":"避免該類已刪除給付規定，卻持續沿用舊制核扣費用之情形，再請各審\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[64.2239990234375,447.2460021972656,559.1646118164062,463.20599365234375]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b15","raw_text":"查醫藥專家多加注意。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":12,"bbox":[64.2239990234375,477.2460021972656,232.19000244140625,493.20599365234375]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b16","raw_text":"結論：符合藥品給付規定，處方降血脂藥物達標後，是否維持原劑量或減輕\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[36.119998931884766,507.2460021972656,559.1572265625,523.2059936523438]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p11-b17","raw_text":"劑量，應尊重臨床醫師意見。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[64.2239990234375,537.2460327148438,280.19000244140625,553.2059936523438]},{"page":12,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p12-b1","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.119998931884766,47.216041564941406,44.099998474121094,63.17604064941406]},{"page":12,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p12-b2","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,77.23600006103516,43.97999954223633,93.19599914550781]}],"source_quality":["第 12 頁文字品質待核對"]}